WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.751
YouTube holds some of the best teaching in the world.

2
00:00:03.751 --> 00:00:05.579
But it's scattered.

3
00:00:05.579 --> 00:00:10.924
No order, no checkpoints, and no way to know you've really got it.

4
00:00:12.233 --> 00:00:16.045
Vortex turns those videos into real courses.

5
00:00:16.045 --> 00:00:22.028
Ordered lessons, progress that saves, and a quiz after every video.

6
00:00:22.028 --> 00:00:24.777
And the creators always stay credited.

7
00:00:26.067 --> 00:00:27.979
Looking for something specific?

8
00:00:27.979 --> 00:00:30.246
Just ask in plain English.

9
00:00:30.246 --> 00:00:34.359
Vortex ranks the lessons that teach it, and takes you straight there.

10
00:00:35.667 --> 00:00:37.866
Pick a course and enroll for free.

11
00:00:37.866 --> 00:00:43.138
Watch right on the page, and your place saves to the second, so you can pick up where you left off.

12
00:00:44.433 --> 00:00:47.838
When a video ends, take a short quiz.

13
00:00:47.838 --> 00:00:54.575
Submit, see your grade and what you missed, then retake it until you pass.

14
00:00:55.867 --> 00:00:59.225
Want to learn something that isn't in the catalog yet?

15
00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:04.714
Describe your goal, and Vortex builds you a personal plan from videos that fit.

16
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.565
Vortex.

17
00:01:07.565 --> 00:01:13.218
Learn anything from YouTube, the way a course teaches it.
